  "body": "Brand-new | 5 Bedrooms (3 with ensuites & walk-in wardrobes) | 4 Separate Living Areas | 4.5 Bath | Wide & Unobstructed Reserve Frontage | Separate-access Bedroom & Living Suite | Endless Possibilities\r\n\r\nSitting proudly on a wide-frontage site with unobstructed reserve views across the road, this brand-new residence blends comfort, sophistication, and privacy with multiple living zones - perfect for families at every stage, returning relatives, long-term guests, or rental opportunities, all wrapped in an exquisitely finished coastal package.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you enter the double-height void, a sense of openness and quality craftsmanship is evident. Natural light pours through expansive windows, connecting both levels and creating a warm, welcoming atmosphere. The layout is intelligently designed: the ground floor features a private 3-metre high ceiling lounge with full-height sliders and its own heat pump, while a separate one-bedroom suite with external access, living area, ensuite, walk-in wardrobe, and heat pump offers flexibility for extended family, guests, independent living, or rental income.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the north-facing open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area captures all-day sun and flows seamlessly to a private deck, extending the living space outdoors. The kitchen makes a bold statement with a contrasting dark palette, designer lighting, premium appliances, and a secondary scullery with gas cooktop - ideal for serious cooking while keeping the main space pristine. Tailored cabinetry adds depth and modern sophistication.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a sun-filled living area opens to a suspended balcony with sweeping reserve views. Four well-positioned bedrooms ensure harmony, including two master suites with ensuites and walk-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nYear-round comfort is thoughtfully delivered with ducted, multi-zone air conditioning throughout the main living areas and upstairs bedrooms, plus separate heat pumps for the downstairs lounge and one-bedroom suite. A double internal-access garage with integrated laundry is complemented by two off-street parks. The fully fenced 493sqm (mol) section sits behind an electric gate, offering low maintenance and a strong sense of arrival.\r\n\r\nLocated in Long Bay, convenience is unmatched - Long Bay Village, beach, regional park, sports fields, playgrounds, and top-decile schools are all within minutes. This is a home designed to grow with you.\r\n\r\nFEATURES THAT ELEVATE EVERYDAY LIVING\r\nDesign & Flexibility\r\n* Brand-new | 5 Bedrooms | 4.5 Bath (including 3 with ensuites & walk-in wardrobes)\r\n* 4 Separate living areas - Multi-living zones for flexible connection and separation\r\n* 3m-stud high ceiling lounge, with independent heat pump\r\n* Separate-access one bedroom suite with dedicated living area, ensuite, walk-in wardrobe independent heat pump\r\n* Upstairs family living with balcony opening to sweeping reserve views\r\n* Stylish Kitchen with contrasting dark colour palette and premium appliances\r\n* Dedicated secondary scullery kitchen with a gas cooktop\r\n* Tailored cabinetry designed with bold, contrasting dark hues\r\n* North-facing main living, dining & kitchen opening to private outdoor deck\r\n* Welcoming high entry void with expansive windows and abundant natural light\r\n* Designer Lighting, quality craftsmanship, premium fixtures & finishes\r\n\r\nOutlook & Privacy\r\n* Unobstructed reserve frontage - No neighbours across the road with open view\r\n* Fully fenced, wide frontage, Low-maintenance, 493m2 (mol) section\r\n* Private, north-facing outdoor flow from living to backyard entertainment area\r\n* Electric front gate & security intercom system\r\n* Digital door lock\r\n\r\nClimate & Comfort\r\n* Fully ducted central air conditioning (multi-zone) with individual climate control\r\n* 2 additional independent heat pumps to separate lounge and one bedroom suite\r\n* Underfloor heating to all fully tiled bathrooms\r\n\r\nParking & Location Convenience\r\n* Double internal-access garage with integrated laundry\r\n* Two additional off-street parking spaces\r\n* Minimal upkeep landscaping & low maintaince exterior build\r\n* Right opposite Long Bay Village, 1 minute drive or a pleasant stroll to, cafes, restaurants, gym, medical centre and New World Long Bay \r\n* Moments to Long Bay Regional Park & coastline, schools and sports fields\r\n* Zone for Northcross Intermediate, Long Bay School & College\r\n\r\nBuilt with uncompromising craftsmanship and flexible family living in mind, every finish, fixture, and design choice comes together to create a home that stands the test of time. So be quick! Seize this incredible opportunity to elevate your living at Long Bay with this amazing home- contact us now for more information or to arrange for a private viewing!\r\n\r\nFor more information and documents please see links below:\r\nhttps://vltre.co/PU9hKZ\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/AM7K",
